  "description": "JOKFUN crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H56 Dy4 N12 O16,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.832-3.843 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.85-114.98°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H72Dy4N12O20.",
